{
  "bookId": "hero-213006",
  "id": "bond-26048",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "26048001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "龙马，你每天坚持正坐静心，这我并不反对。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26048002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "每次一坐就是四个小时，隔绝外界的干扰纹丝不动，真的很令人佩服。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26048003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "但你能不能换个地方，不要坐在水龙头下面！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26048004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "......\n............",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26048005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "......算了，我换个地方去洗手吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26048006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "你可以正常使用水龙头，不会影响到我。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26048007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "水流能让我更加冷静。\n心静，则不会在意外物的干扰。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26048008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "但是，看到你在下面坐着，我根本没法心安理得地洗手。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26048009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "可我做不到像你一样，完全不被所处环境影响。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26048010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "我还没有达到那种境界。\n你看，今天的静坐已经被在意的事情打断了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26048011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26048012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "仓田龙马",
          "text": "你的提问。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
